---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /pricing/
title: "Yacht Charter Pricing & Terms | Supernova Expeditions"
description: "Supernova Expeditions pricing: per stateroom rates for scheduled trips, whole boat private charters from $3,900/night & dry boat rentals. Anacortes, WA."
hero:
  image: "main-salon.webp"
  alt: "Supernova's main salon with built in seating and wide windows"
  h1: "Supernova Yacht Charter Pricing"
  jump: {"label": "Compare the Options", "href": "#options"}
  sub: "Three ways to travel aboard Supernova. Every price is per night, and every trip starts and ends in Anacortes."
---
{% from "macros.njk" import book %}
{% include "hero.njk" %}
<section id="options" style="padding-top:40px;scroll-margin-top:100px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="center">Choose how you travel</h2>
    <div class="options">
      <a class="option" href="#scheduled">
        <span class="opt-label">Book a stateroom</span>
        <h3>Scheduled Expeditions</h3>
        <p class="opt-price"><small>From</small> $1,300</p><p class="opt-unit">per stateroom, per night</p>
        <p class="opt-value">Sleeps two, so from $650 per person. All inclusive.</p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Captain, mate and private chef</li>
          <li>All meals and beverages*</li>
          <li>Paddleboards and kayaks</li>
          <li>Fuel and cleaning included</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="more">See stateroom rates</span>
      </a>
      <a class="option featured" href="#private">
        <span class="opt-label">The whole boat</span>
        <h3>Private Charter</h3>
        <p class="opt-price">$3,900</p><p class="opt-unit">per night, whole boat</p>
        <p class="opt-value">Up to 6 guests, about $650 each with a full boat.</p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Your group only, your route</li>
          <li>Captain and mate</li>
          <li>Paddleboards, kayaks and tender</li>
          <li>Add a private chef, landing craft or divemaster</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="more">See charter details</span>
      </a>
      <a class="option" href="#dry-boat">
        <span class="opt-label">Skipper it yourself</span>
        <h3>Dry Boat Charter</h3>
        <p class="opt-price">$3,400</p><p class="opt-unit">per night</p>
        <p class="opt-value">For licensed, experienced captains.</p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li>Exclusive use of Supernova</li>
          <li>Sleeps 8 in four staterooms</li>
          <li>Captain Paul on call 24/7</li>
          <li>Optional skipper coaching</li>
        </ul>
        <span class="more">See requirements</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="center" style="margin-top:28px">Mountain bike expeditions are priced per rider. <a href="/mountain-bike-expeditions/">See the bike page</a>. [CONFIRM bike pricing.]</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-sand" id="scheduled" style="scroll-margin-top:100px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Scheduled expeditions</span>
    <h2>Stateroom rates, per night</h2>
    <p>Join a pre planned trip and book by the stateroom. Each room sleeps two and has its own bathroom and shower.</p>
    <div class="rate-grid" role="table" aria-label="Stateroom rates per night by trip type">
      <div class="rg-row rg-head" role="row">
        <span role="columnheader">Stateroom</span>
        <span role="columnheader"><a href="/private-charters/">Discovery Cruise</a><small>Paddle, hike, explore</small></span>
        <span role="columnheader">Culinary Cruise<small>With a guest chef</small></span>
        <span role="columnheader"><a href="/scuba-diving-expeditions/">Scuba Expedition</a><small>Landing craft + divemaster</small></span>
      </div>
      <div class="rg-row" role="row"><span role="rowheader"><b>Master Stateroom</b><small>King bed, largest bathroom</small></span><span role="cell" data-label="Discovery">$2,100</span><span role="cell" data-label="Culinary">$2,300</span><span role="cell" data-label="Scuba">$2,500</span></div>
      <div class="rg-row" role="row"><span role="rowheader"><b>The Mermaid Room</b><small>Queen bed in the bow</small></span><span role="cell" data-label="Discovery">$1,600</span><span role="cell" data-label="Culinary">$1,800</span><span role="cell" data-label="Scuba">$1,900</span></div>
      <div class="rg-row" role="row"><span role="rowheader"><b>The Salmon Room</b><small>Queen bed, calm and cozy</small></span><span role="cell" data-label="Discovery">$1,300</span><span role="cell" data-label="Culinary">$1,500</span><span role="cell" data-label="Scuba">$1,700</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="included">
      <p class="included-title">Every scheduled trip includes</p>
      <ul class="checklist cols-2">
        <li>Captain, mate and private chef</li>
        <li>Chef prepared meals and beverages*</li>
        <li>4 paddleboards and 2 kayaks</li>
        <li>Fuel, cleaning and damage deposit coverage</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="note">*[CONFIRM what the asterisk on beverages covers.]</p>
    </div>
    {{ book(site, "/calendar/") }}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="private" style="scroll-margin-top:100px">
  <div class="wrap split" style="align-items:start">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Private charter</span>
      <h2>$3,900 per night, the whole boat</h2>
      <p>Supernova, Captain Paul and a mate for your group of up to 6 guests. You choose the pace and we plan the route with you. Minimum 2 nights, up to 30.</p>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Captain and mate</li>
        <li>4 paddleboards, 2 kayaks and a 15 foot tender</li>
        <li>Self catered, or add a private chef</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="example">
        <p class="example-title">Example: 6 guests with a private chef</p>
        <p>$3,900 charter + $1,200 chef = <b>$5,100 per night</b>, or <b>$850 per guest</b> with all meals, house beer, wine and spirits.</p>
      </div>
      {{ book(site, "/calendar/?trip=private#request") }}
    </div>
    <div class="price-card">
      <p class="card-title">Private chef, per night</p>
      <p>Chef prepared meals plus house beer, wine and standard spirits.</p>
      <table class="rate-table">
        <tr><td>2 guests</td><td>$800</td></tr>
        <tr><td>4 guests</td><td>$1,000</td></tr>
        <tr><td>6 guests</td><td>$1,200</td></tr>
      </table>
      <p class="card-title" style="margin-top:22px">Add ons, per night</p>
      <table class="rate-table">
        <tr><td>Landing craft<small>Diving, biking, beach landings</small></td><td>$500</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Divemaster<small>Or dive self guided</small></td><td>$500</td></tr>
      </table>
      <p class="card-title" style="margin-top:22px">One time charges</p>
      <table class="rate-table">
        <tr><td>Cleaning fee</td><td>$400</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Damage deposit<small>Refundable</small></td><td>$500</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Fuel deposit<small>Settled at trip end</small></td><td>$1,000</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-sand" id="dry-boat" style="scroll-margin-top:100px">
  <div class="wrap split" style="align-items:start">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Dry boat charter</span>
      <h2>$3,400 per night, you skipper</h2>
      <p>Exclusive use of Supernova for licensed, experienced captains. You bring food, beverages and fuel and run the boat; we make sure you're ready first.</p>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Pre qualification and approval before booking</li>
        <li>Full orientation on every system</li>
        <li>Captain Paul on call 24/7 by phone or radio</li>
        <li>Sleeps 8 in four staterooms, plus 4 on the top deck</li>
      </ul>
      {{ book(site, "/calendar/?trip=dry#request") }}
    </div>
    <div class="price-card">
      <p class="card-title">Skipper coaching</p>
      <p class="from">$500 <small>per night</small></p>
      <p>A USCG 100 ton Master aboard when you're underway, with daily training. Nearby and on call around the clock.</p>
      <details class="topics"><summary>What you'll learn</summary>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Navigation and chart plotting</li>
        <li>Boat handling and anchoring</li>
        <li>Trip and route planning</li>
        <li>Watermaker and freshwater systems</li>
        <li>Battery and energy management</li>
        <li>Systems and routine maintenance</li>
        <li>Waste and sewage management</li>
        <li>Marine radio operation</li>
        <li>Emergency preparedness and safety</li>
      </ul></details>
      <p class="card-title" style="margin-top:22px">Deposits</p>
      <table class="rate-table">
        <tr><td>Damage deposit<small>Refundable</small></td><td>$1,000</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Fuel deposit<small>Settled at trip end</small></td><td>$400/day</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:56px 0">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:860px">
    <h2>Good to know</h2>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>Prices are per night. Private and dry boat charters are 2 nights minimum.</li>
      <li>Every trip starts and ends in Anacortes, WA. Other pickup points are available for an added fuel charge.</li>
      <li>Crewed trips carry up to 6 guests under U.S. Coast Guard rules.</li>
      <li>Trips into Canada need valid travel documents for every guest.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Questions or a custom quote? Call <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phone }}</a> or see the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

